sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer's admin
  participant T as You (Terraform)
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as Cirrus Watch Admin
  participant K as Key vault
  participant X as Customer tenant
  T->>T: terraform output customer_onboarding
  T-->>C: the steps
  C->>X: app registration, client secret, Graph consent, Reader roles
  C-->>T: tenant ID, client ID, subscriptions
  T->>W: add to customers, apply: container, roles, groups, DASHBOARD_TENANTS
  W->>W: restarts with the new tenant
  C-->>A: client secret (a safe channel)
  A->>W: Settings, Customer tenants, Edit: paste the secret
  W->>K: store dashboard-... secret
  A->>W: Test
  W->>X: sign in as their app, read the token's permissions and the roles
  X-->>W: ok, or what is missing
  W->>X: next scheduled run or Run now scans the tenant
